          "type": "heading",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Reproduction Overview"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown-block",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "content": "**Paper:** *Multiple Heads Are Better Than One: Mixture of Modality Knowledge Experts for Entity Representation Learning*\n**Task:** Multimodal knowledge graph link prediction\n**Experiments:** MKG-W and MKG-Y main-result reproductions, both completed at 2,000 epochs.\n**Source:** [zjukg/MoMoK](https://github.com/zjukg/MoMoK) at `99c2df114d48c79708ea0608644b685183d81bd9`.\n\nBoth runs satisfy the group's **STRONG_MATCH** criterion: all reported\nabsolute metric deltas are below 0.01. This is our reproduction criterion,\nnot terminology proposed by the MoMoK paper.\n\nRuns: [MKG-W](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/k2evocuw) · [MKG-Y](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/tp1184w7)"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Experimental Setup"
            }
          ],
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown-block",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "content": "**Official implementation:** [zjukg/MoMoK](https://github.com/zjukg/MoMoK)\n\n**Public reproduction repository:** [https://github.com/trandainien1/MoMoK](https://github.com/trandainien1/MoMoK)\n\n**Pinned upstream commit:** [`99c2df114d48c79708ea0608644b685183d81bd9`](https://github.com/zjukg/MoMoK/commit/99c2df114d48c79708ea0608644b685183d81bd9)\n\n**Stable reproduction tag:** [https://github.com/trandainien1/MoMoK/tree/course-momok-main-results-v1](https://github.com/trandainien1/MoMoK/tree/course-momok-main-results-v1)\n\n| Setting | MKG-W | MKG-Y |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Epochs | 2000 | 2000 |\n| Batch size | 1024 | 1024 |\n| Seed | 10010 | 10010 |\n| Experts | 3 | 3 |\n| Evaluation | every 100 epochs | every 100 epochs |\n| Learning rate | 0.001 | 0.0005 |\n| μ | 0.0001 | 0.0001 |\n| Embedding dimension | 200 | 300 |\n| Entities | 15000 | 15000 |\n| Relations | 169 | 28 |\n| Train triples | 34196 | 21310 |\n| Valid triples | 4276 | 2665 |\n| Test triples | 4274 | 2663 |\n| Execution | Kaggle GPU | Kaggle / Tesla T4 |"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "MKG-W Main Result"
